* [https://cyber.meme.tips/xorjs/ XorJS] - In-browser file xor utility ([https://github.com/ae27ff/xorjs source code])

I have also contributed several different WASM hashing libraries to [https://github.com/tweqx/3301-hash-alarm Tweqx's 3301 Hash Alarm extension].</text>
